{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53376","headline":"除授太学国子监司籍之职因赋 · 何坚","name":"除授太学国子监司籍之职因赋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九重天子重英豪，御殿传恩赐绿袍。\n乐道直欲学商尹，致君恒切佐唐尧。\n琼林日照宫花灿，金榜风摇姓字高。\n幸荷召颁入太学，相期联步觐天朝。\n（见同前书卷十一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"何坚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53376.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53376","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}